      "SourceCategory": "OfficialDocs",
      "EvidenceStrength": "ExplicitStatement",
      "TargetField": "integration.Configuration.IdempotencySupport",
      "Excerpt": "To perform an idempotent request, provide an additional Idempotency-Key header... Stripe's idempotency layer compares the incoming parameters with those of the original request... Keys expire after 24 hours."
    },
